    "affected_api": "sympy.ntheory.elliptic_curve.EllipticCurve.__add__",
    "observed_behavior": "In the point-addition code for elliptic curves, the point-at-infinity test in the P + (-P) branch checked only (y1 + y2) == 0, which ignores the a1*x1 + a3 terms of the general Weierstrass curve, so P + (-P) was not correctly handled for some points.",
